1. Her VTuber model was created by an artist known as "Lulu Lulu," who is referred to as her "VTuber mama." (Verbatim: "so here is my mama it is it's lulu is lulu wait let me get up lulu lulu lulu lulu it's lulu lulu yeah yeah yeah this is my vtuber mama is lulu lulu lulu um")

2. Her model rigging is being handled by a rigger known as her "VTuber papa," who was recommended through another VTuber named Emma. (Verbatim: "my vtuber papa was actually um thanks to a certain wonderful wonderful wonderful wonderful vtuber who will now be my stepsister... emma emma was like yo my papa's got commissions open wanna like you can go for them")

3. She considers other VTubers created by Lulu Lulu to be her "sisters," and she plans to find and connect with them. (Verbatim: "you'll be able to see who my sisters are because my sisters don't even know they're my sisters yet")

4. Her debut model is expected to be completed around July or August, as the rigging process takes several months. (Verbatim: "they said about until July slash August, so yeah, and it's currently May, so it does take a while")

5. She used a temporary model purchased from Nizima (and possibly Etsy) that cost around $60, which she will use until her custom model is ready. (Verbatim: "this is a temporary model that anyone can buy from Nizima... this is a 60 buckaroo")

6. She wanted extensive rigging features for her debut model and requested "all the bells and whistles please." (Verbatim: "I went full out with asking what I wanted for rigging, I was basically like 'onagai shimasu, all the bells and whistles please'")

7. She gets nervous before big events, which sometimes causes her to lose sleep. (Verbatim: "i was so nervous for today that i just didn't sleep because i'm dumb and i get nervous and then when i get nervous i don't sleep")

8. She values her community deeply and works hard to give back to them in return for their support. (Verbatim: "I work hard because of how happy you make me and I need to return the happiness infinity plus one vote")

9. She humorously claims that "infinity plus one" is the largest number and rejects adding more to it. (Verbatim: "there's no number bigger than infinity plus one... No, you can't add another plus one or a plus two to my infinity plus one. It doesn't work like that.")

10. She jokes that her temporary model is not a goose, despite her hissing sounding like a goose to others. (Verbatim: "Sorry. I was going to hiss, but apparently my hisses sound like a goose and y'all think... this isn't a goose model you punks") [end of text]



1. Her primary goal is to make people happy and spread kindness, happiness, and joy. (Verbatim: "literally all all all i want is to just try and make people happy... i'm just trying to bring kindness happiness and joy")

2. She does not want to engage in conflict and emphasizes being kind over being confrontational. (Verbatim: "i'm not here to fight anybody")

3. She enjoys the things she likes without concern for others' judgments, including specific colors and anime characters. (Verbatim: "i like the things i like i like the colors i like i like the anime characters i like")

4. She considers Belvita biscuits as a substitute breakfast but refers to porridge or oats as her "super adult breakfast." (Verbatim: "i have belvita i didn't have my super adult breakfast i didn't have my porridge or oats")

5. She likes chicken burgers but limits herself because eating too many is bad for her. (Verbatim: "i can't eat too many chicken burgers no too many chicken burgers is bad for me but they are yummy though")

6. She expresses interest in trying Japanese McDonald's food. (Verbatim: "i'm looking forward to trying japanese mcdonald's as well japanese mcdonald's would be good")

7. She had a Belvita biscuit with strawberry flavor on this occasion. (Verbatim: "i have it was a different bell vita it wasn't just a dry one it's like um it had strawberry or something on it")

8. She identifies herself metaphorically as a "celestial message" rather than a swan or goose. (Verbatim: "i'm not a swan i'm not a goose i'm a celestial message")

9. Her daily routine includes a morning stream, lunch, going to the gym, working on projects, and an evening stream. (Verbatim: "the way i've laid out my days now is i'll have my morning stream have a lunch go to the gym then do afternoon working on projects and then evening stream")

10. She goes to the gym with the goal of getting toned, not "swole" or building a large physique. (Verbatim: "i'm not looking to get swole i'm looking to get toned toning not no not not portfolio now") [end of text]



1. She is a celestial messenger who fell to Earth, died, and was reincarnated. (Verbatim: "my lore is i was a celestial messenger that came to earth tripped fell over died reincarnated and now i'm here")  
2. She was reborn in England and identifies with British culture. (Verbatim: "i got born in england after that")  
3. She has UK size four feet, which she describes as tiny. (Verbatim: "i have uk size four feet")  
4. Her VTuber model is being rigged by two people: Kohi for the main rig and Nova for the full face V-bridger. (Verbatim: "kohi will be um rigging will be rigging my model" and "the one that will be doing my v bridger my full face v bridger is nova")  
5. She wants more facial expressions in her new model because she feels her current face looks stiff. (Verbatim: "i feel like my face is so stiff in this form so i'll be getting... a full full face v bridger")  
6. She refers to her character mascots as "stanana" and "starling," which are also community names for her fans. (Verbatim: "you can either be a stanana or starling")  
7. The starlings in her lore are described as mischievous or a menace. (Verbatim: "i don't know how the starlings ended up being like such a menace but yeah they are menace")  
8. She owns a celestial messenger bag that holds her "magic banana." (Verbatim: "it's my um celestial messenger bag where i store my magic banana")  
9. Her model includes removable clothing, specifically a coat. (Verbatim: "the coat will be removable um so i will show you a form without my coat")  
10. She wears black loafers as part of her character design, which she calls traditional or historically inspired footwear. (Verbatim: "i got a little black loafers yeah little cute shoes") [end of text]



1. She has a celestial messenger bag that stores her "magic banana," which is not for lunch. (Verbatim: "um celestial messenger bag where i store my magic banana... the magic banana is not for lunch")

