4. Her face design is an enhanced version of her real face with more detail. (Verbatim: "as you can see it's not true it's it's it's more like enhanced version of my current face you know more detail")

5. She has big braids (or plaits) that go all the way down. (Verbatim: "yeah yeah but me there look at that bag... i have these big braids big braids that go all the way down")

6. She has flat feet with weak arches, causing her feet to naturally fall inwards. (Verbatim: "um but yeah so this is very accurate and i have i have actual flat feet so well not flat it's more like i messed up my feet and now they just naturally fall inwards because my arches aren't very strong")

7. Her knees naturally go inwards, which is accurately reflected in her model design. (Verbatim: "you can see there's like a little detail on the socks we've got very accurate knees because my knees do go inwards")

