1. She lived in a jungle for three months, which was a significant period in her life. (Verbatim: "I lived in the jungle for like three months... it was a big time for me.")
2. Her signature hairstyle of two tight braids originated from her time in the jungle, as it was practical for avoiding snags. (Verbatim: "The hairstyle of having two braids for me is the hairstyle I kept... for the whole time that I lived in the jungle.")
3. She wore a bucket hat while in the jungle to protect herself from leeches and sun exposure. (Verbatim: "I'd keep my hair like this and have a little bucket hat... it stops them from dropping on your face.")
4. She is skilled at avoiding leeches and had fewer leech encounters than others at the site. (Verbatim: "I was really really heckin good at avoiding leeches... I had the least leeches.")
5. She once had a leech attach to her belly without noticing, which fed fully before detaching. (Verbatim: "I looked down and I was like oh damn I think I've been stabbed... it went and must have had a full-on meal on my belly.")
6. She wore thick socks (referred to as "leech socks" or football/soccer socks) tucked into her trousers to prevent leech bites. (Verbatim: "You have to tuck your trousers into the socks... they're just like these thick thick things.")
7. She used a UV-protective parasol and high SPF sunscreen, especially on her nose, which turns red easily in the sun. (Verbatim: "I had a little parasol thing... I always have to make sure I put sun cream on my face and especially on the little button end of my nose.")
8. Her skin is sensitive to sun exposure, turning very pale when indoors and tanning easily when outside. (Verbatim: "My skin changes color really easily... I can go full on to white but I also tan really easy.")
9. She comes from a family where sun protection is emphasized, especially during visits to "Asialand," contrasting with English tanning culture. (Verbatim: "My family are very much like... get her in the shade now careful the sun is harming her beautiful skin.")
10. She plans to climb Mount Fuji in July and is considering renting climbing equipment since her suitcase broke. (Verbatim: "I'll go in July... I don't have a suitcase right now my suitcase broke so I need to get a new suitcase.") [end of text]



1. Her favorite color is purple, which has been her preferred color scheme for everything in her life. (Verbatim: "purple has always been like my my color scheme of like everything i've had in life like even from like my old room decor to like to like everything else")

2. Her name "Elia" was created by combining elements she liked, avoiding the name "Leah" due to a classmate from secondary school. (Verbatim: "elia just comes from the fact i like yeah i like the yeah at the end and l makes me think of like lila and stuff so and then it just got combined into ellia because i didn't want to have the name leah")

3. She had a negative experience with a girl named Leah during secondary school, which influenced her name choice. (Verbatim: "bad memories with um what you call it um that person called leah back in secondary school oh gosh oh gosh oh gosh")

4. She attended secondary school in the UK, which she describes as covering ages 10 to 16 (Year 7 to Year 11). (Verbatim: "secondary school is like year seven to year eleven so like 10 to 16. i think ages")

5. She wants to climb Mount Fuji in the future and plans to do so while looking cute. (Verbatim: "no i'm gonna look try and look cute climbing mount fuji and no one's gonna stop me")

6. She dislikes carrying large backpacks because they are painful and cause her to lose balance. (Verbatim: "carrying a backpack like that's bigger than me hurts it hurts i remember always losing my balance with these giant backpacks of pain")

7. She is a fan of anime figurines and owns many, with shelves full of them that she feels may need expanding. (Verbatim: "i need something big enough to carry all my anime figurines that i'll be getting")

8. She finds horror games frightening and reacts strongly to them, even joking about jumping to the floor. (Verbatim: "you can see how i truly react in horror games yeah yeah yeah yeah yeah yeah where i literally do jump to the floor and eat my head")

9. She values kindness deeply and considers her primary life wish to be making the people around her happy. (Verbatim: "i've only ever had one wish i've only ever had one wish and that's just to make the people around me happy")

10. She is inspired by the character Amelia from *Re:Zero* for her model design, particularly in terms of visual elements like the bow and hairstyle. (Verbatim: "is amelia from ray zero yeah yeah yeah yeah so you see the this is the inspo this is the inspo um just a little bit um yeah you got the plats the bow the open shoulder the bun") [end of text]



